{%- comment -%}
  Product card / pack (design guide §7). Used for flavors, flights and the
  box. The card is the flavor's ground with the foil sheen:
  - top: `wicz craft` in mono (deep), and an outlined `holiday` pill when
    custom.seasonal is true
  - the name in display type, in the flavor's ink (40–48px, allowed by §3.3).
    Multi-word names stack one word per line (§4.3).
  - flights: flavor dots from custom.flight_contents
  - bottom: `cultured 48 hours` in mono (deep)
  The price sits below the card, in mono. Hover: no shadow, the card lifts
  2px and its bottom edge darkens to the flavor's fold color.

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} product with custom.* flavor metafields
  - heading_level: {String} 'h2' or 'h3' (default 'h3')
  - lazy_load: {Boolean} lazy-load the image (default true)

  Usage:
  {% render 'wicz-flavor-card', product: product %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign tag = heading_level | default: 'h3'
  assign image_loading = 'lazy'
  if lazy_load == false
    assign image_loading = 'eager'
  endif
  assign words = product.title | downcase | split: ' '
  assign flight_contents = product.metafields.custom.flight_contents.value
-%}
<article class="wicz-card" style="{% render 'wicz-flavor-vars', product: product %}">
  <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="wicz-card__link">
    <div class="wicz-card__pack foil">
      <div class="wicz-card__top">
        <span class="wicz-card__brand">wicz craft</span>
        {%- if product.metafields.custom.seasonal.value == true -%}
          <span class="wicz-card__holiday">holiday</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- if product.featured_media -%}
        {{
          product.featured_media
          | image_url: width: 900
          | image_tag:
            loading: image_loading,
            widths: '300, 450, 600, 900',
            sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 280px, (min-width: 750px) 45vw, 90vw',
            class: 'wicz-card__image'
        }}
      {%- endif -%}

      <{{ tag }} class="wicz-card__title">
        {%- for word in words -%}
          <span>{{ word | escape }}</span>
          {%- unless forloop.last %} {% endunless -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </{{ tag }}>

      {%- if flight_contents != blank -%}
        {%- render 'wicz-flavor-dots', handles: flight_contents -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      <span class="wicz-card__process">cultured 48 hours</span>
    </div>

    <p class="wicz-card__price">
      {%- if product.price == 0 -%}
        <span class="wicz-placeholder">[PRICE]</span>
      {%- elsif product.price_varies -%}
        {{ product.price_min | money }} – {{ product.price_max | money }}
      {%- else -%}
        {{ product.price | money }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </p>
  </a>
</article>
